    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d271-a1">

                <pb facs="0372" n="298" xml:id="pg298"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>M. Drouyn de Lhuys to Mr.
                        Bigelow</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-04-13"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 13, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I had the honor to write to you on the 29th
                    and 30th March, to let you know that I had called the attention of the minister
                    of war to the reclamations of Messrs. Todry and François, who were the objects
                    of your letters of the 27th and 29th of same month.</p>
                <p>Marshal Randon has just informed me, and I hasten to let you know, that these two
                    persons have been set at liberty. Moreover, orders have been given for
                    suspension of the judicial action, to which they were subject on the score of
                    the offence of refractoriness, until the civil courts before which MM. Todry and
                    François will have to present themselves shall decide whether they have or have
                    not lost the quality of Frenchmen, and since what time.</p>
                <p>Accept, &amp;c., &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>DROUYN DE LHUYS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bigelow, <hi rendition="#italic"
                                >&amp;c</hi><hi rendition="#italic">.</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                                >&amp;c</hi>., <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c</hi></hi><hi
                            rendition="#italic">.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
